sequenceDiagram
 participant W as Open WebUI
 participant P as PEP
 participant K as Keycloak
 participant O as OPA
 W->>P: Human OAuth bearer and chat
 P->>P: JWT validation and registry binding
 P->>K: Introspect current token
 K-->>P: Active subject
 P->>O: Trusted subject, tenant, roles, action, model, quota
 O-->>P: Versioned allow or default deny
 P->>P: Enforce before secret/gateway access
